# graphify corpus rules. Read after .gitignore, last-match-wins.
#
# This repo's .gitignore hides most of its architecture from graphify:
#   *.md        -> all of docs/ (only !CLAUDE.md is negated)
#   supabase/   -> every migration and edge function
#   backend/supabase_schema.sql -> the only definition of the live
#                  sessions/messages tables
# Those are re-included below. Genuine noise is excluded after.

# --- re-include content .gitignore hides but the graph needs ---
!docs/
!docs/**
!supabase/
!supabase/**
!README.md
!backend/supabase_schema.sql
!frontend/src/lib/
!frontend/src/lib/**

# --- exclude genuine noise ---
docs/_archive/          # 61 superseded docs; CLAUDE.md says ignore these
docs/.obsidian/         # 2.6 MB minified plugin bundle (main.js)

# MIDAS-Vault is indexed, minus its own scaffolding and superseded notes
docs/MIDAS-Vault/90 - Templates/
docs/MIDAS-Vault/99 - Archive/

# duplicate-file hazard flagged in CLAUDE.md: shadow copies that would
# otherwise create competing nodes for the same module
* 2.*
* 3.*
*_old.*
*-new.*
*.backup
*-edge-function.*
